We added the title card and posted Gina's Song (March of the Tsundere) to You Tube! 

Gina wants to see this video hit ten thousand views... if it does she says she may let Anthony have that kiss. Maybe. 

Special thanks to @itamiworks dude it was epic to get a chance to work with you! You rock!

One last thing: Gina insisted on showing off her Fumos. So special shout out to:
@Leaflit 
@celestiumart 
@BananaJuju_ 
We're all big fans in the Kwoon. Also... the rule of thumb in the Kwoon is when in doubt, let the Tsundere win. 

Have a good night everyone! 

